      "machineHash": "fbac6ffe4ac60fd3f799e15bc26a9c1c014fe8d6b7166bc246af1cc04d2316ad",
      "machineText": "全局快捷键是系统级键盘快捷键。只要 Wails 应用仍在运行，无论当前哪个应用获得焦点，它们都能触发。它们非常适合用于显示/隐藏热键、快速捕获工具、媒体控制，以及用户希望能从任何位置访问的其他功能。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Global shortcuts are system-wide keyboard shortcuts that fire regardless of which application curren…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
