      "machineText": "回调不在主线程上运行。如果回调需要与窗口或其他 UI 交互，窗口方法会替你处理线程调度；但对于自定义的主线程操作，请使用`application.InvokeSync`将其包装起来。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Callbacks run off the main thread. If your callback needs to interact with windows or other UI, that…",
