      "machineHash": "d10b9ed4591006ff83695ac987722c2f8f34560a1b571fd6578667d507fbfe67",
      "machineText": "全局快捷键使用 Carbon Event Manager 的热键 API。这是 macOS 上实现系统级热键的标准机制，无需辅助功能权限。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Global shortcuts use the Carbon Event Manager's hot key API. This is the standard mechanism for syst…",
