      "machineHash": "2f797ec62685a648bd7cc83ff4cbb5596ae72a62a289a47ff3d232982b873015",
      "machineText": "热键绑定到物理按键位置，因此在非 QWERTY 键盘布局上，快捷键会映射到标准 ANSI/QWERTY 布局中相应位置的按键。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Hot keys are bound to physical key positions, so a shortcut maps to the key in the standard ANSI/QWE…",
