    "b0036-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "96c8bbe91fa80d96abf75995e85d4e5db905a20f4f4534e760683b50e32fbb24",
      "targetHash": "9ec882d48b34a0decaad41510110701a74ef87ec7e930611f907a906b5c93e78",
      "machineHash": "9ec882d48b34a0decaad41510110701a74ef87ec7e930611f907a906b5c93e78",
      "machineText": "在 macOS 上，`window.Hide()`使用`orderOut:`，这会使窗口不可见。AppKit 会将最后一个不可见窗口视为已关闭，因此，如果设置了`Mac.ApplicationShouldTerminateAfterLastWindowClosed: true`，并使用全局快捷键隐藏唯一的窗口，应用将退出，而不是继续在后台运行。依赖隐藏/显示热键时，请不要设置该选项（默认即为未设置），这样窗口便可隐藏，并在之后重新调出。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "`window.Hide()` uses `orderOut:` on macOS, which makes the window non-visible. AppKit treats the las…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:49Z"
    },
    "b0037-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "e7d658ea614d40c80669d22a1ecb477283faef5285c9870556eb907cf13a7401",
      "targetHash": "780d727bf8ed2fe060cf9af27f7ef6f08291881cea6c62b58b00d99d70f2d311",
      "machineHash": "780d727bf8ed2fe060cf9af27f7ef6f08291881cea6c62b58b00d99d70f2d311",
      "machineText": "全局快捷键使用 Win32 `RegisterHotKey` API。系统会抑制自动重复，因此按住组合键只会触发一次回调，而不会反复触发。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Global shortcuts use the Win32 `RegisterHotKey` API. Auto repeat is suppressed, so holding the keys …",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
