      "machineHash": "cfbf51259a2b0f82b2f78160c6af2e63b8c091edbfc081cc5d8504e63685e19d",
      "machineText": "在*X11*会话中，Wails 直接从 X 服务器获取快捷键，因此请求的加速键会完全按照指定方式绑定。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "On *X11* sessions Wails grabs the shortcut directly from the X server, so the requested accelerator …",
